sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Manager/Specialist
    participant UI as Weekly Report UI
    participant API as Report API
    participant Auth as JWT/RBAC
    participant Task as Task Service
    participant DB as Database

    User->>UI: Chọn tuần, năm, project, member
    User->>UI: Auto-fill
    UI->>API: GET /weekly-reports?filters
    API->>Auth: Xác thực và kiểm quyền
    Auth-->>API: Cho phép
    API->>Task: buildWeeklyReport(filters)
    Task->>DB: Lấy task Done trong tuần
    DB-->>Task: completed tasks
    Task->>DB: Lấy task kế hoạch tuần kế tiếp
    DB-->>Task: planned tasks
    Task->>DB: Lấy Backlog/Pending/Cancel + reason
    DB-->>Task: blocked tasks
    Task->>DB: Lấy task có bodSupport
    DB-->>Task: support requests
    Task-->>API: 4 sections + weekly logs
    API-->>UI: Report DTO
    UI-->>User: Hiển thị báo cáo
    opt Xuất TXT/PDF
      User->>UI: Export
      UI->>API: POST /exports/weekly-report
      API-->>UI: File hoặc jobId
    end

